PAL16R8
3; 11; 5; 12 13 14 15 16 17 18 19;
6; 12 13 14 15 16 17 18 19; 7; 21 22 23 24 25 26 27 28;
2; 1; 4; 12 13 14 15 16 17 18 19 21 22 23 24 25 26 27 28;
1; 12 13 14 15 16 17 18 19; 1; 21 22 23 24 25 26 27 28;
END

! *******************************************************************
! ** DEVICE:   PAL18U8 
! ** DATABOOK: PAGE 
! **
! ** DESCRIPTION:
! **    - Create TRST equations from pin 11.
