! ** DATABOOK: PAGE 5-65
! **
! ** DESCRIPTION:
! **    - Create an output equation for pin 15 or 16.  If one does not
! **      have an output equation create it from the other.  Give it the
! **      correct polarity.
! **
PAL16C1
9; 15; 10; 16;
9; 16; 11; 15;
END

! *******************************************************************
! ** DEVICE:   PAL20C1 
! ** DATABOOK: PAGE 5-157
! **
! ** DESCRIPTION:
! **    - Create an output equation for pin 18 or 19.  If one does not
! **      have an output equation create it from the other.  Give it the
! **      correct polarity.
! **
PAL20C1
9; 18; 10; 19;
9; 19; 11; 18;
END

